---
description: Twig templates and public bundle assets of ManualKitBundle
globs:
  - "src/Resources/views/**/*.twig"
  - "src/Resources/public/**/*"
  - "src/Resources/translations/*.yaml"
alwaysApply: false
---

Prefer:
- small, backward-compatible template changes that keep the documented blocks (`title`, `stylesheets`, `body`), CSS
  classes (`.nowo-manual__*`, `--nowo-manual-*`), `data-testid` hooks and the Stimulus identifier
  `nowo-manual-lightbox` (see `docs/TEMPLATES.md`)
- linking published files through the bundle's asset package: `asset('css/manual.css', 'nowo_manual_kit')` — never a
  hard-coded `/bundles/nowomanualkit/...` path (REQ-ASSETS-004)
- the `NowoManualKitBundle` translation domain; keep the 7 catalogues in key parity (`make validate-translations`)
- `rendered.html|raw` only for sanitiser output, inside `.manual-prose`

Do not edit `src/Resources/public/js/manual-lightbox.js` by hand: it is the Vite build of
`src/Resources/assets/src/manual-lightbox.ts` (`make assets`).
Do not rewrite whole templates for a local change.
